        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1347936864,
        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "The wood is locally used in construction. The bark can be used in tanning. The nuts are considered edible.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "id": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (id): Berangan jawa § Kegunaan",
